# {{projectName}}

A Tenkit Generic With Standalone App Variants project generated for Expo SDK 57.

## Highlights

- {{appVariants.[0].displayName}} is the Generic App Variant.
- {{appVariants.[1].displayName}} is a Standalone App Variant.
- Runtime Tenant records live in generated source data.
- {{appVariants.[0].displayName}} can select North Studio, South Studio, and East Studio at runtime.
- {{appVariants.[1].displayName}} opens West Studio directly and does not show Runtime Tenant selection.
- `APP_VARIANT_SLUG` selects the App Variant for Expo config and Build Preparation.
- The Generated App Local CLI is for this project only. It is separate from Tenkit's Public CLI create flow.
{{#if isUnistylesStyling}}
- Uses Unistyles for generated UI styling. Customize themes and tokens in `unistyles.ts`.
{{/if}}

